WEBVTT

00:00:00.108 --> 00:00:06.082
Converting an enquiry to a student

00:00:06.132 --> 00:00:11.421
Only Confirmed enquiries can be converted. They have a checkbox.

00:00:16.338 --> 00:00:21.131
Tick the enquiry. A bar appears with Convert to students.

00:00:24.369 --> 00:00:26.708
Press Convert to students.

00:00:29.722 --> 00:00:33.686
Choose the academic year, then the class and section.

00:00:38.613 --> 00:00:43.376
Press Convert. The student record and enrollment are created.

00:00:47.213 --> 00:00:51.895
Student admitted
